.SH "NAME"
cpmregistry\-packages\-dist\-list\-bundle \- Download bundle
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B cpmregistry packages:dist list\-bundle
\fIversion\-command\fR \fB\-\-name\fR \fI<value>\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Returns the bundle for a specific package version: the artifact the in\-game cpm client installs from. Format: `<manifest byte length>\en<minified manifest JSON><raw concatenated file bytes>`, where the manifest is `{ name, version, files: [{ path, offset, length }] }` with offsets relative to the first byte after the manifest. Served gzip\-encoded on the wire to clients that send `Accept\-Encoding: gzip`; `dist.bundle.sha256` is the SHA\-256 of the decoded bytes.
